app                     Navigate to browser-based Shiny implementation
                        of PREVENT equations
estimate_risk           Estimate risk of cardiovascular events using
                        the American Heart Association (AHA) Predicting
                        Risk of cardiovascular disease EVENTs (PREVENT)
                        equations, with optional comparison to their
                        _de facto_ predecessor, the Pooled Cohort
                        Equations (PCEs) from the AHA and American
                        College of Cardiology (ACC)
plot_risk               Plot risk estimates from 'estimate_risk()'
